  "summary": "The experiment tested an RNA-only model using PCA encoding without image data or fusion. Validation accuracy of 0.485 suggests moderate performance, with validation F1 of 0.464 supporting this baseline. The result provides an initial reference for RNA-only models but lacks comparative evidence to assess the impact of multimodal components or alternative encodings."
}

